 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Twelve spies went up through the Negev land",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They came to Hebron, a fortified town",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They saw Ahiman, Sheshai, and Talmai",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Descendants of Anak, giants in the place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We seemed like grasshoppers in our own eyes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And so we seemed to them, they said",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people were strong, the cities so large",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fear filled the hearts of Israel's band",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Caleb quieted the people before Moses",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We should go up and take possession now",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For we are well able to do it, he declared",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though the men with him said, no, we cannot fight",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We seemed like grasshoppers in our own eyes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And so we seemed to them, they said",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people were strong, the cities so large",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fear filled the hearts of Israel's band",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Joshua blessed Caleb and gave him the hill",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He followed the Lord wholeheartedly, they say",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Hebron belongs to Caleb to this day",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because he trusted in God's promise",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Caleb drove out the three sons of Anak",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sheshai, Ahiman, and Talmai fell",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Judah marched against the Canaanites there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And defeated the giants in the valley",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We seemed like grasshoppers in our own eyes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
